<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Educational Journey</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eef8f5;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .timeline {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .event {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 6px solid #555;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .year {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="timeline">

    <h1>🎓 My Educational Journey</h1>

    <div class="event">
        <div class="year">2018</div>
        <h2>🏫 Primary Education</h2>
        <p>
            Started my early school education and developed
            basic reading, writing and mathematical skills.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="event">
        <div class="year">2022</div>
        <h2>📖 Secondary Education</h2>
        <p>
            Studied different subjects and discovered new interests.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="event">
        <div class="year">2025</div>
        <h2>🎯 Higher Secondary Education</h2>
        <p>
            Focused on subjects related to future career interests.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="event">
        <div class="year">2026</div>
        <h2>💻 College Journey</h2>
        <p>
            Started studying Computer Science and began learning
            programming and web development.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
